# 默认自动识别文本，显式列出的源码和配置使用 LF；Windows 启动脚本使用 CRLF，避免不同工具产生换行噪声。
# EN: Detect text automatically, set LF for the listed source/configuration patterns, and CRLF for Windows launch scripts.
* text=auto
*.md text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
.env.example text eol=lf
.prettierignore text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# 上游许可证按原始字节保留，禁用文本换行转换及空白检查，避免修改其缩进与换行。
# EN: Preserve upstream license bytes, disabling text conversion and whitespace checks to retain original indentation and line endings.
assets/distribution/*-LICENSE.txt -text -whitespace
